The search of htr.c for one line, in C, verified with VST (DeepSpec)
===================================================================

htr3.c        the search part of code/APaul/capla/htr3/run/htr.c, on a flat
              array of k*l words: add (htr.c's ADD 2, with gcc's intrinsic
              _addcarry_u64, i.e. adc; clightgen sees a prototype instead of
              <immintrin.h>) and sub (htr.c's own statements, at two
              offsets), difftab, tstep_load (one step of the table, each
              word read once, as htr_load.c of exp-full-proof: a holds the
              old B_t, b the old B_(t+1), loaded once, B_t = a + b with
              _addcarry_u64, then b becomes a; l <= 10), tstep_add (the step
              with add, for l > 10), tstep (calls tstep_load with k and l
              written as constants for the 12 pairs (k, l) of the table
              files, with l alone for other l <= 10, so that gcc -O3 unrolls
              it; tstep_add otherwise), search (returns the candidates j)
main.c        unverified driver: reads a table file in htr.c's format (each
              line x0 N k l B..., 1 <= k <= 13, 1 <= l <= 8) and prints the
              candidates x0 + j u.  Usage: htr3 FILE ERR (e.g. 0x600000)
htr3_clight.v generated: `clightgen -normalize htr3.c`, what VST reasons on

Words.v       plain Z: words, valZ (the value of a list of words)
Common.v      the C types, vwords (an array of words as VST values)
Fdiff.v       forward differences, the in-place passes of difftab
Spec_add.v    add_spec, and addcarry_spec: the statement of _addcarry_u64
              (writes a + b + c mod 2^64, returns the carry), assumed;
              Spec_search.v  search_spec, with window, table,
              cand, cands (as code/APaul/rocq/HtrDefs.v)
Verif_add.v, Verif_sub.v, Verif_difftab.v, Verif_tstep.v (tstep_add),
Verif_tstep_load.v (tstep_load, tstep), Verif_search.v
              body_<f> : semax_body Vprog Gprog f_<f> <f>_spec
Verif_htr3.v  htr3_funcs_correct: semax_func over the seven functions; the
              only callee spec not proved is addcarry_spec, which is in the
              context of the statement (Gassumed = addcarry_spec :: Gprog)
link/         links to code/APaul/rocq (APaulRocq) and code/exptablekl
              (ExpTableKL), built here (`make ports`)
TableCands.v  cands_line: on a line with line_ok, every hard j < n is in
              cands (HtrMath, TaylorLink.hscan_exp; mathcomp, no VST)
VstTable.v    vst_search_line, vst_search_table: from line_ok (or
              check_raw) and the postcondition of search_spec, every hard
              j < n is among the first count entries of out, when
              count <= cap

Speed (one thread, Intel Core Ultra 7 165U, gcc 15.3 -O3 -march=native;
same candidates as htr.c): in0 of exp-full-proof (k = 11, l = 7), each line
cut to N/300000 inputs, 6.9 s; in800 (k = 13, l = 8), cut to N/30000, 9.6 s;
a table file with k = 12, l = 8 (the most frequent pair), cut to N/33733,
14.3 s.  The previous htr3.c (add with l constant, no tstep_load): 10.6,
13.1 and 17.9 s; htr_load.c: 6.6, 9.2 and 12.7 s; the first htr3.c (htr.c's
add, nothing constant): 22.7 s on in0 and 44.2 s with k = 12, l = 8.  The
pragmas GCC unroll in tstep_load are needed: without them gcc stops unrolling
at the larger pairs and l = 8 is slower than before.  The switches of tstep
are on ints (kl = 16 k + l, s = l), as VST has no rule for a switch on a
64-bit value, and each case ends with break, as VST requires.

search_spec: on an array holding B_0 .. B_(k-1) (l words each), search
returns the number of candidates j < n (cands of the table of differences
with the window err) and writes the first cap of them in out.  Assumptions
(Print Assumptions): only VST's standard axioms (classical logic,
functional and propositional extensionality, eq_rect_eq, Ensembles
extensionality); nothing admitted.  Assumed (in the statement, not as an
axiom): addcarry_spec, the statement of gcc's intrinsic _addcarry_u64, the
adc instruction.  Not proved: main.c, and htr.c's own I/O, GMP and OpenMP
parts (outside htr3.c).

Build: the opam switch `vst` (Rocq 9.0, CompCert 3.17, VST 2.16):
  eval $(opam env --root=/home/thery/opam-rocq.9.1.0 --switch=vst)
  make            htr3 (gcc), htr3_clight.v (clightgen) and the proofs
